<SubSection title="Boundary and Initial Conditions" id="Boundary and Initial Conditions">
 <p> To obtain a particular solution, we must solve the general governing equation utilizing known quantities called boundary conditions (which describe heat 
transfer at particular surfaces and interfaces) as well as initial conditions (for unsteady state or time-dependent problems). </p> 
</SubSection>
